# Files Docker never sends to a build. The Dockerfiles start with "COPY . .", so everything
# not listed here would end up in the build context.

# Installed inside the image with npm ci; the host's copies are for Windows and huge.
**/node_modules

# Secrets stay out of images. Services get them at run time (env_file in docker-compose.yml).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed to build or run a service.
.git
.turbo
**/dist
**/out
**/*.log
infra
